Hyper-realistic photo of a young woman on an outdoor wooden deck beside a modern swimming pool. Slightly rear three-quarter angle, she gracefully turns toward the camera in a natural S-curve, one arm raised gently holding her hair. Fitted white backless crop top with short sleeves, loose black pants. Lush green plants, calm reflective water, contemporary buildings faintly in the distance. Late afternoon soft diffused daylight, gentle highlights on cheekbones and shoulders, no harsh shadows. Serene, stylish lifestyle mood, editorial depth-of-field, realistic skin texture.

{
  "image_generation_prompt": {
    "style": "Hyper-realistic photograph",
    "subject": {
      "demographic": "Young woman",
      "pose": {
        "angle": "Slightly rear three-quarter angle",
        "posture": "Gracefully turning upper body and head toward camera, natural S-curve",
        "arms": "One arm raised gently holding hair, other arm resting naturally by side",
        "vibe": "Candid, effortless"
      },
      "face_and_identity": {
        "constraint": "Use uploaded photo as exact and only reference",
        "preservation": "100% facial structure, bone proportions, eyes, nose, lips, skin texture, natural asymmetry",
        "prohibitions": "No alterations, filters, or stylization",
        "expression": "Calm, subtly confident, slightly curious"
      },
      "hair": "Dark, straight, silky, tied in mid-height ponytail with loose front strands framing face",
      "outfit": {
        "top": "Fitted white backless crop top with short sleeves",
        "bottom": "Loose-fitting black pants sitting comfortably at the waist",
        "contrast": "Clean black-and-white"
      }
    },
    "environment": {
      "location": "Outdoors on a wooden deck beside a modern landscaped swimming pool",
      "elements": [
        "Lush green plants",
        "Small trees",
        "Calm reflective water",
        "Contemporary buildings faintly visible in distance"
      ]
    },
    "technical_details": {
      "lighting": "Natural soft daylight (late afternoon), even illumination, gentle highlights on cheekbones/shoulders/back, soft diffused light, no harsh shadows",
      "colors": "Fresh natural palette, greens, soft blues, warm wood tones, neutral clothing",
      "mood": "Serene, stylish, lifestyle-oriented, peaceful, effortlessly fashionable",
      "focus": "Natural anatomy, realistic skin texture, subtle highlights/reflections, photographic depth-of-field (editorial feel)"
    }
  }
}

Create a bright and light retro commercial advertisement visual around a specific beverage theme: the first impression should establish a memory point with an oversized, thick, rounded theme logo. The font should look like a soft, inflated signage block with light color filling and clean edges, anchoring the upper visual center of gravity. The main beverage form appears in the lower center with a realistic product photography texture, zoomed in, with clear highlights, condensation or liquid luster, and natural shadows, overlapping the background and part of the text to create a strong sense of depth between the graphic elements and the real product. The background uses radial blocks spreading out from near the subject, with sharp edges and dense rhythm, creating a sense of speed and cheerful impact. The text system is divided into three layers: the main logo is the largest, the subtitle uses a narrow and tall retro uppercase font closely following it, small information is scattered in the corners, and handwritten italic short phrases cross around the subject in arcs or slanting lines, with a few white line-drawn arcs, flash symbols, and small markers added to enhance the rhythm. Colors are extracted from the beverage's flavor, material, and brand emotion, maintaining the relationship between large areas of clear structural color, a few strong contrast accent colors, light information text, and warm main subject color; the overall result is high brightness, high saturation, yet clean and ventilated, with clear color steps, fresh, playful, and energetic emotions, avoiding dark, dirty, muddy layers, or low-vitality retro graininess.

——————
Display Ratio: {argument name="display ratio" default="Vertical 3:4"}, suitable for shopping mall beverage pop-up stands
Main Subject: {argument name="main subject" default="A cup of lychee iced tea close to the bottom, with lychee pulp and ice cubes inside, and a straw slightly sticking out"}
On-site Text: {argument name="text content" default="Main logo 'Lychee Opening', subtitle 'LYCHEE ICED TEA', corner small text 'Weekend limited 100 cups'"}
Feeling for passers-by: Like a sweet drink sign that attracts people from afar while shopping

Subject: ({argument name="theme" default="Ancient Chinese folk tales"})
{argument name="story" default="The Eight Immortals Cross the Sea"}
{argument name="scene" default="a fleeting dream, all for nothing"}

Create a 16:9 image.

[PROJECT CARD]
Create a compact designed masthead, not a table.
TITLE: {argument name="project title" default="RAND / RUN BEFORE THE SHIFT"}
META LINE: {argument name="scene meta" default="public chase intro / surreal glitch curse / rising panic"}
PRIORITY: {argument name="camera shot" default="one continuous front-tracking shot"}, Rand

{
  "task": "image_to_image_style_transfer",
  "input_image": "{{USER_IMAGE}}",
  "prompt": "Create a hyper-real 3D studio composition that recreates the main subject from the provided image as a fragmented stone assemblage. The subject must be built from separate, clearly detached rock pieces with small visible gaps between shards (no pieces merging). Material look: fragmented slate + sandstone shards with chiseled edges, crisp fractures, visible stone grain, micro-scratches, and realistic roughness. Color palette: predominantly dark slate with subtle warm-ochre sandstone accents. Lighting: soft studio key light from top-left, gentle fill, subtle contact shadows under each shard, realistic ambient occlusion in crevices, clean reflections kept minimal. Background: minimal off-white seamless backdrop, no texture. Framing: centered, clean, straight-on, subject fully readable. Add a few tiny debris chips floating or resting near the base for depth. Preserve the subject’s identity, proportions, and recognizable silhouette from the input image while transforming all surfaces into stone fragments. Hyper-real, high detail, sharp focus, 8k render quality.",
  "negative_prompt": "text, typography, logo, watermark, signature, extra props, busy background, fog, heavy bloom, cartoon, illustration, lowpoly, plastic, metal, glossy paint, melted shapes, merged fragments, unreadable subject, blur, noise, low resolution, oversharpening halos, distorted face/body, extra limbs, deformed geometry",
  "output": {
    "aspect_ratio": "use_input_aspect_ratio",
    "background": "off_white",
    "camera": {
      "angle": "straight_on",
      "framing": "centered",
      "distance": "medium"
    }
  },
  "params": {
    "style_strength": 0.75,
    "identity_preservation": 0.9,
    "detail_level": "very_high",
    "lighting_preset": "soft_studio_top_left",
    "shadow_intensity": "subtle",
    "gap_visibility": "clear",
    "debris_chips": "few_tiny",
    "no_text": true
  }
}

Generate a bright and refreshing graphic-text synthesis based on a specific theme: the image uses a large area of high-brightness pure color field to support the main subject, with a flat and airy background devoid of complex depth of field. The visual focus is established by a portrait or real subject boldly cropped from below, revealing only the most memorable parts as if entering from the edge of the screen. A minimalist graphic symbol or object-like character is overlaid on top of the subject, appearing to sit gently on the subject's head or grow along its silhouette, with a rounded shape, clean edges, and expressions or structures made of a few thick lines, combining a sense of identity with approachability. Text is an active character: use a large handwritten-style title at the top with loose spacing and soft strokes; use a stronger vertical or axial title in the center to establish hierarchy; and place small-font information at the edges to remain quiet but precise, letting white space dominate. Colors are extracted from the theme's material, emotion, geography, or brand semantics, mapped as bright base colors, clean subject highlights, clear dark structural lines, and minimal accent colors; overall maintaining high brightness, clarity, and cleanliness with clear but not over-stimulating saturation, using dark colors only for structure and readability. A contrast between realistic photography and flat graphics creates a balance of reality and playfulness, with accurate edge overlays and minimal shadows, resulting in a relaxed visual system like a combination of public promotion and character illustration.

Theme: {argument name="subject" default="Liu Yan"}

Aspect ratio 9:16

Generate a minimalist ink-wash glyph visual around a specific theme, transforming keywords or names into abstract signature-like structures. The composition features sparse, dark brushstrokes with varying textures—dry, wet, and raw edges—to create an authentic oriental handwriting feel. The visual center is slightly off-middle, surrounded by ample clean white space to evoke emotion and rhythm. Colors are extracted from the theme's mood but remain clear and bright. The final result should look like a unique handwritten title or an abstract symbol, avoiding standard fonts or dense poster styles.

Text: {argument name="text" default="Old Man Yang"}

Aspect Ratio: {argument name="aspect ratio" default="16:9"} landscape

{
 "reference_images": {
  "scene_reference": "ATTACHED_IMAGE",
  "usage_rule": "Use this image as the exact source for scene layout, object placement, and composition. Do not reinterpret or replace the scene."
 },
 "concept": {
  "type": "miniature diorama reconstruction",
  "intent": "Rebuild the attached scene as a clean, collectible-scale diorama while preserving the original spatial relationships"
 },
 "environment": {
  "scale": "tabletop miniature",
  "ground": {
   "type": "sculpted base",
   "behavior": "supports all objects naturally without enclosure",
   "edges": "clean, minimal, slightly beveled"
  },
  "background": {
   "type": "seamless studio backdrop",
   "color": "pure white",
   "constraint": "no environment beyond the diorama base"
  }
 },
 "objects_and_elements": {
  "layout_rule": "All objects must remain in the same relative positions as in the reference image",
  "primary_elements": "exact vehicles, structures, props, and terrain visible in the reference",
  "detail_handling": "simplified but faithful miniature proportions",
  "characters": {
   "presence": "only if present in the reference",
   "style": "miniature figurines, no facial realism"
  }
 },
 "composition": {
  "view": "isometric or slightly elevated 3/4 perspective",
  "framing": "entire diorama visible, centered",
  "cropping": "no zoom, no cinematic crop"
 },
 "camera": {
  "lens_equivalent": "35mm-50mm",
  "perspective": "miniature realism",
  "distortion": "none"
 },
 "lighting": {
  "type": "soft studio lighting",
  "direction": "overhead and slightly angled",
  "shadows": "subtle contact shadows only beneath objects",
  "avoid": ["dramatic lighting", "spotlights", "cinematic contrast"]
 },
 "materials_and_style": {
  "surface_finish": "smooth, matte or lightly satin",
  "material_quality": "high-quality scale model materials",
  "aesthetic": "clean, modern, premium diorama"
 },
 "quality_controls": {
  "image_clarity": "ultra-clean",
  "grain": "none",
  "noise": "none",
  "motion_blur": "none"
 },
 "negative_prompts": [
  "glass case", "display box", "museum enclosure",
  "transparent cube", "protective casing",
  "reflections on glass", "labels or plaques",
  "text overlays", "busy background", "cinematic blur"
 ]
}
